{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1:#0f1724; /* deep navy */
      --bg2:#071226; /* near-black teal */
      --accent:#d9c1ff; /* warm lavender */
      --muted:#9aa9b4;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --cta-grad: linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6bff,#ff9ec1);
      --radius:16px;
      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;color:#e6eef6;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
      overflow-y:auto;
    }
    /* Split diagonal layout */
    .canvas{position:relative;min-height:100vh;padding:48px 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 640px;gap:32px;align-items:start}
    @media(max-width:980px){.canvas{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:28px 18px}}

    /* Diagonal overlay */
    .diagonal{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:60%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;overflow:hidden}
    .diagonal:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-20% -10% -10% -40%;background:radial-gradient(1000px 400px at 20% 10%, rgba(139,107,255,0.12), transparent 20%), radial-gradient(600px 200px at 85% 90%, rgba(255,158,193,0.06), transparent 18%);transform:skewX(-12deg);}

    /* Inline svg pattern sits beneath content */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-40px;top:8%;width:680px;opacity:0.12;filter:blur(6px);transform:rotate(-6deg)}

    header{position:relative;z-index:2;grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--cta-grad);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--cta-grad);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;color:#061226}

    main{position:relative;z-index:2}
    .hero{padding:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02), 0 8px 36px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}
    @media(min-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 360px}}

    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}
    .card h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* Form styles */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,select,textarea{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#eaf2ff}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .row .flex{flex:1}
    .submit{margin-top:6px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:none;background:var(--cta-grad);color:#061226;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    /* Diagnostic section: quick triage */
    .diagnostic{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}

    /* Plan & flow */
    .plan-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .plan-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    .plan-item b{display:block;color:#fff}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Micro-habits */
    .habits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
    @media(max-width:720px){.habits{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .habit{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}

    /* Pricing snapshot */
    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .tier{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);min-width:120px}
    .price{font-size:20px;color:#fff;font-weight:700}

    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Accent svg icons */
    .icon{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6b8bff,#ff9ec1);display:inline-grid;place-items:center;color:#061226;font-weight:700}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="diagonal" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- decorative svg pattern: unique to this page -->
    <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 800 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#6b6bff" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#ff9ec1" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <filter id="f1"><feTurbulence baseFrequency="0.6" numOctaves="2" stitchTiles="stitch"/><feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0"/></filter>
      </defs>
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="800" height="800" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.6" transform="rotate(-15 400 400)"/>
      <g fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" transform="translate(20,20)">
        <circle cx="150" cy="110" r="72" />
        <rect x="420" y="40" width="160" height="160" rx="24" />
        <path d="M540 560c-30 30-80 40-120 15s-60-80-30-110 80-40 120-15 60 80 30 110z" />
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="canvas">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="color:#fff;font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted">An intimate sound sanctuary — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/about.html">About us</a>
        <a href="/events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero card">
        <h1>Reach out to the sound sanctuary</h1>
        <p class="lead">Tell us a little about what you need — membership enquiries, private sessions, or questions about an upcoming ritual. We respond with care and practical next steps.</p>

        <div class="grid">
          <div>
            <div class="diagnostic" style="margin-top:12px">
              <span class="pill">Membership available</span>
              <div style="flex:1"></div>
              <div class="muted">Prefer a one-on-one? Choose Private Session below.</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
              <h3>Contact form</h3>
              <form id="contactForm">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="e.g. Jordan" required>

                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>

                <div class="row">
                  <div class="flex">
                    <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                    <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
                  </div>
                  <div style="width:180px">
                    <label for="service">Service</label>
                    <select id="service" name="service">
                      <option>Next Event / Membership</option>
                      <option>Private 1:1 Session</option>
                      <option>Couples</option>
                      <option>Corporate / Workplace</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <label for="message">How can we help?</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you're seeking, possible dates, and any accommodations."></textarea>

                <button type="submit" class="submit">Send inquiry</button>
                <div id="formStatus" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px"></div>
              </form>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
              <h3>Direct lines</h3>
              <div class="muted">Prefer to call or email?</div>
              <p style="margin:10px 0">Phone: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong><br>Email: <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></p>
              <p class="small">We typically respond within 48 hours. If this is about today's event, please call.</p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <aside>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>What to expect when you reach out</h3>
              <div class="plan-list">
                <div class="plan-item">
                  <div class="icon">1</div>
                  <div>
                    <b>Warm reply</b>
                    <div class="small">We acknowledge your message and ask one clarifying question if needed.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="plan-item">
                  <div class="icon">2</div>
                  <div>
                    <b>Offer & options</b>
                    <div class="small">We propose membership tiers, drop-in or private session slots — with transparent pricing.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="plan-item">
                  <div class="icon">3</div>
                  <div>
                    <b>Reserve & prepare</b>
                    <div class="small">We save your spot and share arrival details, what to bring, and any contraindications.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
              <h3>Quick details</h3>
              <div class="muted">Location</div>
              <p style="margin:8px 0"><strong>{{VENUE_NAME}}</strong><br>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
              <div class="muted">Facilitator</div>
              <p style="margin:8px 0"><strong>{{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</strong></p>
            </div>

          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Micro-habits section: short rituals to ready the body -->
      <section class="card" style="margin-top:20px">
        <h3>Gentle practices to prepare</h3>
        <p class="muted">These micro-habits help you arrive more still; try one before your session.</p>
        <div class="habits" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="habit">
            <b>3-minute breathing</b>
            <div class="small">Inhale for 4, hold 2, exhale 6 — anchor attention to your breath.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="habit">
            <b>Hydrate early</b>
            <div class="small">Sip water an hour before; avoid caffeine just prior to the bath.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="habit">
            <b>Soft clothing</b>
            <div class="small">Wear layers you can remove — blankets and bolsters will be provided if needed.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="habit">
            <b>Intention setting</b>
            <div class="small">Spend a minute giving your session a purpose: rest, release, or recalibration.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Pricing snapshot and membership callout -->
      <section style="margin-top:20px" class="card">
        <h3>Pricing & membership (snapshot)</h3>
        <div class="pricing" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="tier">
            <div class="muted">Drop-in</div>
            <div class="price">$35</div>
            <div class="muted">One evening access</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tier">
            <div class="muted">4-class pass</div>
            <div class="price">$120</div>
            <div class="muted">Save 15%</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tier">
            <div class="muted">Membership</div>
            <div class="price">From $55/mo</div>
            <div class="muted">Priority + discounted bookings</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">For full pricing, corporate packages, and private sessions (1:1, couples, workplace), mention your preference in the form above and we'll send the tailored options.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <h3 style="margin:0;color:#fff">Ready to join the circle?</h3>
          <div class="muted">Become a member for preferred booking and savings, or request a private session for deeper recalibration.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="submit" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div class="muted">When you contact us we may ask about medical history and any implanted devices. Sound baths are gentle, sensory-rich experiences led with crystal and metal instruments; they are not a substitute for medical advice.</div>
      </footer>

    </main>

  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      var status = document.getElementById('formStatus');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(ev){
        ev.preventDefault();
        var data = new FormData(form);
        var entries = {};
        data.forEach(function(v,k){entries[k]=v});
        // basic local feedback; integration point: swap to AJAX endpoint or mailer
        status.textContent = 'Thanks ' + (entries.name||'friend') + '. Preparing your inquiry...';
        status.style.color = 'var(--muted)';
        setTimeout(function(){
          status.textContent = 'Message queued. We will reply to ' + (entries.email||'your email') + ' within 48 hours.';
        },800);
        // reset lightly
        form.querySelector('button[type=submit]').disabled = true;
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the "sound_bath" site (chunk 4)

Overview:
- File: contact.html — a complete, standalone contact page styled for a premium sound bath membership offering.
- Purpose: capture inquiries for events, memberships, private sessions (1:1, couples, corporate) and provide practical pre-session guidance.

Design notes & requirements satisfied:
- Layout family: split_diagonal implemented with a diagonal decorative panel and an inline SVG pattern for visual richness.
- Voice: warm_storyteller reflected in micro-habits, polite diagnostic language, and gentle CTAs.
- Offer model: membership emphasized (membership pill, pricing snapshot, membership CTA).
- Required sections included: hero, diagnostic, plan (flow), micro_habits, pricing, cta.
- Sound-bath specifics: includes "what to bring" guidance, contraindications disclaimer, and a short description of the session flow.
- Accessibility: semantic HTML, form controls labeled.

Placeholders (to replace before deployment):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}} (optional — not directly used in this file but may be added)
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}
- {{VENUE_NAME}}
- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} (not used on this page but present site-wide)

Integration & customization tips:
- The contact form currently provides local feedback but does not send to a server. Replace the form submit handler with an AJAX POST to your backend endpoint or integrate with a serverless mailer.
- The page uses only embedded CSS and an inline SVG — no external images, fonts, or CDNs.
- To add analytics or full form processing, hook into the form submit event in the <script> block near the bottom.
- The SVG pattern is unique to this page and intentionally low-contrast. If you create assets/img/pattern.svg for other pages, make it visually distinct.

Editing guidance:
- Colors and gradients are in :root for quick updates.
- Header nav labels vary across site pages; ensure links remain correct when copying elements to other templates.
- Pricing section is intentionally a short snapshot. Full pricing details live on pricing.html and private-sessions.html.

Deployment:
- Drop this file into the root or appropriate templates folder of your static site.
- Replace placeholders with real content before publishing.

Contact for further edits:
- If you want alternate instrument lists, sensory metaphors, or a stricter accessibility audit, update the copy and test with a screen reader.

